                                        "tags": [
                                            "nonstandard"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25465e64-2379-4a79-b0da-0a8ce5d0c440",
                                                "sense_id": "e176e5a9-fa2d-3477-9834-dcb4b496d4c4",
                                                "text": "He was a great masseuse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4da7bf65-2169-4c23-b5ad-a85d9ffd2a72",
                                                "sense_id": "e176e5a9-fa2d-3477-9834-dcb4b496d4c4",
                                                "text": "He was a good masseuse, and could always make Jez relax."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66a0b25d-4d29-415a-9f27-f88907e42e87",
                                                "sense_id": "e176e5a9-fa2d-3477-9834-dcb4b496d4c4",
                                                "text": "Waited, got up, opened the door and saw the masseuse playing backgammon. Told him I was ready, didn't know what for. He waved me away, and I returned to the slab. By the time he came in, a mustached masseuse was sponging down a German woman on the opposite side of the marble; her husband sat on the perimeter watching (this was not a traditional hamam)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "475bf908-5113-4345-88d3-5ba723bc2f0d",
                                                "sense_id": "e176e5a9-fa2d-3477-9834-dcb4b496d4c4",
                                                "text": "year unknown, Jamie Lake, BOOK 4 - Bad Boy: Naughty at Night: Bad Boy | Gay Romance MM Boyfriend Series, Jamie Lake\nJust less than a week ago, he'd said he'd tell Peter's parents, his school, the press, that Peter was an erotic masseuse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dec3d510-9628-40e1-9c4b-7ea6ca6130ae",
                                                "sense_id": "e176e5a9-fa2d-3477-9834-dcb4b496d4c4",
                                                "text": "In most massages, both the male masseuse and the female client are naked and the focus is on erogenous zones."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
